      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Common maintenance procedures",
      "source_hash": 1250972913712992444,
      "context_hash": 8565308196901455815,
      "translation": "일반적인 유지 관리 절차",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:32.655490Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Adding a new domain",
      "source_hash": 7978408618547565984,
      "context_hash": 15737042501088897398,
      "translation": "새 도메인 추가하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:32.655490Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "First, edit `sudo vim /etc/nginx/nginx.conf` to edit the nginx configuration to add the domain.",
      "source_hash": 4136222346987521527,
      "context_hash": 4748954881299951649,
      "translation": "먼저 `sudo vim /etc/nginx/nginx.conf`를 편집하여 도메인을 추가하도록 nginx 설정을 수정하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:32.655490Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Then run `sudo -i -u ssl-renew vim renew.sh`.",
      "source_hash": 17757308050774112543,
      "context_hash": 13142769543317530064,
      "translation": "그런 다음 `sudo -i -u ssl-renew vim renew.sh`를 실행하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:32.655490Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Add a `--domains` line to the script with the domain you're adding.",
      "source_hash": 8856982267364722753,
      "context_hash": 12824080887374466362,
      "translation": "추가하려는 도메인으로 `--domains` 줄을 스크립트에 추가하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:32.655490Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Then, run the script: `sudo -i -u ssl-renew ./renew.sh`",
      "source_hash": 3274462576862081703,
      "context_hash": 4079283787544889932,
      "translation": "그런 다음 스크립트를 실행하십시오: `sudo -i -u ssl-renew ./renew.sh`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:32.655490Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}